OL,3,AUproar over missing 'pop' as Rice
OL,4,AKrispies changes its recipe
OL,5,
OL,6,FRice Krispies and Coco Pops,
OL,7,Flong-standing staples of the family
OL,8,Fbreakfast table, will no longer be made
OL,9,Fof whole rice grains in the UK, after
OL,10,FKellogg's said it was changing its
OL,11,Frecipe.
OL,13,FInstead the tiny toasted puffs will be
OL,14,Fmade using corn flour and rice flour,
OL,15,Fand will also now contain wheat gluten
OL,16,Fas an ingredient.
OL,18,FA Kellogg's spokesperson said the
OL,19,Freformulation was due to "changing
OL,20,Fweather conditions" that have disrupted
OL,21,Fsupplies of some grains and cereals.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
